{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15210330","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032001:":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog45>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCAB2BD21B2EA823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032002:":{"text":"내가 정말 그렇게 잘못한 걸까?","source_cn":"我真的做得很糟糕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F3F0506C7CD625D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032003:":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog104>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7BE6E6A945A0962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032004:":{"text":"보칼리스의 재난이 전부 다 내 탓인 걸까?","source_cn":"呼临城的灾难是因为我吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91EA26CE34D3012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034001:":{"text":"헉, 헉. 비켜!","source_cn":"呼、呼！麻烦让一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD458CEF998BB9A87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034002:":{"text":"무슨 일이야?","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278B02A51CF19C74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521033001:0":{"text":"내가 너무 못나서... 신께서 보칼리스에 재앙을 내리신 걸까?","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521033001":{"text":"내가 너무 못나서... 신께서 보칼리스에 재앙을 내리신 걸까?","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521033002:0":{"text":"나도 어서 자라서 아버지처럼 믿음직스럽고 존경받는 사람이 되고 싶어...","source_cn":"我也想尽快长大，变得像父亲一样可靠，受人尊敬……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF456599BA73263C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521033004:0":{"text":"밥도 먹지 못하는 사람들을 도우려고 여러 방법을 생각했는데, 전부 거절당하고...","source_cn":"我想了很多方法，想要帮助吃不上饭的人，但一直都被否决……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5236BE003634D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521033005:0":{"text":"당신의 방법은 좋지 않았어요. 방금 만난 두 사람이 증명해 주었지요.","source_cn":"你的方法没有那么好。刚刚那对父子的遭遇就证明了这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB49EF1BE86E515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521033006:0":{"text":"더 많은 사람에게 식량을 나눠주려고 모두의 몫을 줄였지만, 그래도 부족했어요.","source_cn":"为了让更多人领到食物，所以每个人都少拿一点。但他们还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C551F2ACAFFC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521033007:0":{"text":"하지만 보칼리스에는 원래 식량이 많았어. 지금보다 몇 배는 더 많았다고!","source_cn":"但城里的食物原本很多，是现在的好几倍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81818CE9FB09A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521033008:0":{"text":"의원들이 아쿠보르를 공격하자면서 식량을 전선으로 보내지 않았다면, 성 안에 먹을게 이렇게 부족하지 않았을 거야...","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521033008":{"text":"의원들이 아쿠보르를 공격하자면서 식량을 전선으로 보내지 않았다면, 성 안에 먹을게 이렇게 부족하지 않았을 거야...","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里的存粮不会这么少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521033009:0":{"text":"당연히 아니지! 보칼리스가 재난을 겪고 있는 상황에서 내가 결정할 수 있었다면, 사람들을 먼저 구했을 거야.","source_cn":"当然不是！呼临城正在受灾，如果我能决定的话，肯定要先救灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E60A8ED58BABA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521033011:0":{"text":"페르세우스는요? 페르세우스는 당신의 말을 들어줬다고 했잖아요.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯呢？你说过，他支持你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC733F568C49279E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521033012:0":{"text":"...페르세우스도 출정을 반대했어. 하지만 비보 선생님이랑 다른 의원들이 고집을 부렸어.","source_cn":"……他确实不同意正面出兵。但是比博老师和其他议事官坚持。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02BE501CA153863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521033013:0":{"text":"다들 기근은 금방 해결할 수 없고, 가뭄을 해결하려면 풍요의 신께 기도하는 수밖에 없다고 했어. 하지만 신께서는 보칼리스를 지켜주지 않으셨으니까... 아쿠보르를 공격하는 것밖에 남지 않았던 거야.","source_cn":"大家都说，饥荒没办法很快解决，干旱也只能向丰饶神祈求，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD19A1A0F788D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521033014:0":{"text":"그게 아니라면 보칼리스인은 다 굶어 죽을테고... 나도 그런 일이 일어나는 건 싫었어!","source_cn":"否则，否则呼临人都会饿死……我不能看着呼临城发生这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC82AD2A4950EB2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521033015:1":{"text":"하지만, 하지만... 그 뒤에 사람들은 또 아쿠보르를 빨리 점령해야 한다고 했어. 그래서 식량을 전부 전선으로 보내는 바람에 먹을 게 점점 줄어들었단 말이야...","source_cn":"可是……可是之后他们又说必须尽快攻占雅库伯尔，所以把很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2D34F4776079CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521033016:0":{"text":"나, 나도 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어... 이젠 돌이킬 수도 없잖아...","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1521033016":{"text":"나, 나도 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어... 이젠 돌이킬 수도 없잖아...","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521033017:0":{"text":"무, 무슨 말인지 알 거 같아...","source_cn":"我、我知道你的意思了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x024A06E58322099C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"무, 무슨 말인지 알 거 같아...","female":"무, 무슨 말인지 알 거 같아...","variant_male_record_index":"181853","variant_female_record_index":"181854","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521033019:0":{"text":"미안해...","source_cn":"对不起……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CC81DDE3A06174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521033020:0":{"text":"당신보다 의원들이 먼저 사과해야 해요.","source_cn":"和你比起来，那些议事官更应该道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C239CD0688F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521033021:0":{"text":"응...?!","source_cn":"咦……？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F74F80CE685FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521033022:0":{"text":"당신은 영주예요. 아무리 나이가 어려도 모두 당신의 명령을 따라야 했어요.","source_cn":"你是领主，无论年纪多小，他们都应该听从你的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40370A4139936EDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521033023:0":{"text":"당신이 전쟁을 원치 않았다면 당신의 선택을 따랐어야 했죠.","source_cn":"你不想开战，他们就应该听从你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D317EA94E910A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521033024:0":{"text":"반항한다면 벌을 줘야 해요. 감금하든, 중노동을 시키든, 아니면 목숨을 바치게 하든.","source_cn":"如果反抗，就该惩罚。关起来，或者做苦力，或者让他们献出生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BD5EE860DE232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl